## Files that are not relicensed

The following stay under the three.js MIT licence, Copyright 2010-2023
Three.js Authors, https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js tag v0.161.0. Their own
headers and notices apply, and this licence does not replace them:

- `lib/three.global.js` — local UMD build of three.js r161
- `lib/three.module.min.js` — local module build of three.js r161
- `lib/EffectComposer.js`, `lib/MaskPass.js`, `lib/Pass.js`,
  `lib/RenderPass.js`, `lib/ShaderPass.js`, `lib/UnrealBloomPass.js`,
  `lib/CopyShader.js`, `lib/LuminosityHighPassShader.js`,
  `lib/SMAAPass.js`, `lib/SMAAShader.js` — postprocessing sources from the
  same three.js release
- the corresponding inlined copies inside `main.js`, marked as the
  "Inlined post-processing classes (three.js r161)" section

SMAA portions keep their upstream notice:
https://github.com/iryoku/smaa
